{"id":"chatcmpl-4320639e-fa08-42c7-a3be-0d6994ef080f","object":"chat.completion","created":1795245050,"model":"deepseek-v4.1-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","reasoning_content":"","content":"```json\n{\n  \"highlights\": \"This task demonstrates a multi-tool consensus strategy for medical image interpretation, where independent vision-language models are queried with targeted questions to resolve a binary diagnostic choice. The key insight is decomposing the diagnostic question into a directional/descriptive sub-question that each tool can answer, then aggregating agreement to select the final option. Cross-validation between independent tools increases confidence and reduces single-model error.\",\n  \"patterns\": [\n    \"Decompose binary diagnostic choices into a descriptive sub-question (presence + direction/attribute) that tools can answer unambiguously before mapping back to the option set.\",\n    \"Query two or more independent tools with the same targeted sub-question and use their agreement as the basis for the final answer.\",\n    \"Frame tool prompts to explicitly request the discriminating attribute (e.g., left vs right, direction of convexity) rather than the raw option label.\",\n    \"When tools agree on the underlying descriptive finding, map that finding deterministically to the corresponding multiple-choice option.\"\n  ],\n  \"playbooks\": {\n    \"Medical imaging multiple-choice\": \"Ask each tool to describe the finding and its discriminating attribute (side, direction, location) rather than pick an option; require consensus across independent tools before answering.\",\n    \"Binary classification with directional labels\": \"Convert the label choice into a 'which direction/attribute' question so tools produce comparable descriptive outputs that can be cross-checked.\",\n    \"Multi-model verification\": \"Use at least two independent models with the same well-scoped prompt; treat agreement as confirmation and disagreement as a signal to re-query or refine.\"\n  },\n  \"checklists\": [\n    \"Confirm each tool's response explicitly addresses the discriminating attribute (e.g., convexity direction) needed to distinguish the options.\",\n    \"Verify that the descriptive findings from all tools map consistently to the same final option before answering.\"\n  ]\n}\n```"},"finish_reason":"stop","logprobs":null}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":488,"total_tokens":879,"completion_tokens":391,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"image_tokens":0,"text_tokens":488},"completion_tokens_details":{"text_tokens":391}}}